      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am deeply concerned about your feelings and want to help you find a way to feel safe.\nPlease know that your pain is valid, but \"rot\" and \"death\" are not the end of a family's story and they cannot decide your life for you.\nI encourage you to talk to a compassionate professional who can help you navigate these heavy emotions without feeling alone in the dark.\nYou have the right to feel something about your life even if it hurts to feel it.",
